WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:04.670
One of the great mysteries, that we all hope
to learn more about in Wano is the creation

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:09.620
of the Poneglyphs. And with the clear focus
on Armament Haki in this arc, I can´t help

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:13.860
but wonder if these, at first glance very
different concepts, might not be connected

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:17.829
in some way after all.
Haki has become a central part of the power

00:00:17.829 --> 00:00:21.880
system in One Piece. While we got occasional
clues in the first half of the series about

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:26.570
its existence, it was not until the 2-year
time skip, that we learned of this other superhuman

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:31.640
phenomenon in the One piece world, beside
the devil fruits. But what exactly IS Haki?

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:35.630
While the Japanese word “Haki” carries
many meanings, the one that probably catches

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:40.480
its nature best is “willpower”. At its
core it is an extension of the will into the

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:43.840
physical world.
Haki exists in every living thing in the One

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:49.200
Piece world. However, most fail to awaken
it and usually are not even aware of its existence.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:53.500
Since it is a physical manifestation of will,
there is a certain limit to how strong it

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:58.930
is and for how long it can be used. As a consequence,
Haki can also be trained and improved.

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:03.970
In general, there are two types of Haki, that
anyone can awaken under the right circumstances

00:01:03.970 --> 00:01:08.560
and with the right training:
The first of these two is Observation or Kenbunshoku

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:13.540
Haki. It functions as an extension of other
natural senses by interacting with the willful

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:17.760
presence of other living things. Dependent
on the level of training, Observation Haki

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:22.100
allows its user to detect the location and
movement as well as the emotions or intentions

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:26.890
of a person. And in its very advanced form,
it can even predict an action slightly into

00:01:26.890 --> 00:01:31.370
the future by reading a person´s will before
it is even translated into a movement.

00:01:31.370 --> 00:01:38.010
The second form of Haki is Armament or Busoshoku
Haki. It gives the users will a physical shape.

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:41.850
So far, we have only seen this in the form
of hardening, but there seems to be more to

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:46.280
it, as we will hopefully find out in this
arc. Still, in principle, depending on the

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:50.700
level of the user, this hardening can still
be overcome by pure physical strength or by

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:55.171
another user with stronger willpower.
Now, while Observation and armament Haki exist

00:01:55.171 --> 00:01:59.460
in EVERY living thing, there is a third kind
of Haki that only a very exclusive group of

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:03.710
people have access to:
Conqueror’s or Haoshoku Haki can only be

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:08.830
awakened by those who have the will of a conqueror.
It uses the strong will of the user to directly

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:13.200
influence the weaker wills of others. We have
so far seen this submission of will in the

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:18.300
form of taming and intimidation as well as
knocking others unconscious. It is still mysterious

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:22.310
though what the true power of Conqueror’s
Haki is and what makes it so unique.

00:02:22.310 --> 00:02:26.700
Now, as a consequence, the introduction of
these three types of willpower into the fighting

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:30.480
system has changed the power distribution
in the One Piece world significantly from

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:35.420
our perspective. Before Haki, if you ate and
acquired the power of a devil fruit, it gave

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:39.730
the person a clear advantage over normal people.
After the time skip though, we learned that

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:44.420
Haki can be used to actively counter Devil
Fruit users. This allowed people WITHOUT a

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:49.950
power to compete at the top as well. In a
way Haki has led to a shift from supernatural

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:54.930
power to individual skill and training when
it comes to fights on a high level. You could

00:02:54.930 --> 00:03:00.260
even argue that especially in the new world,
having strong Haki might be way more important

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:03.879
than owning a devil fruit power.
Still there is a lot we do not know about

00:03:03.879 --> 00:03:08.181
the concept of Haki. While we now know a lot
about Observation Haki, Conqueror’s Haki

00:03:08.181 --> 00:03:12.390
remains mostly a mystery. But we recently
learned a little more about the functioning

00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:17.560
of Armament Haki from Gyukimaru. He explained
to us that Zoro´s sword Shusui turned black

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:22.220
over a certain period of time in the hands
of Ryuma, the hero of Wano. And it seems to

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:25.260
be very likely that this is connected to the
use of Haki.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:29.340
But how exactly does this infusion of objects
with Haki work in the first place? And how

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:32.190
could it be connected to the creation of the
Poneglyphs?

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:37.010
Infusing an object with Armament Haki basically
refers to transferring and manifesting one´s

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:40.670
willpower onto its surface.
So far, we have seen three different ways

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:44.489
of Haki infusion in the story:
The first, and most common use of Armament

00:03:44.489 --> 00:03:48.489
is to coat parts of the user’s own body
or anything in contact with it.

00:03:48.489 --> 00:03:52.450
This seems to be the most basic form of Haki
infusion, that has to be achieved by anyone

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:56.810
who wants to call themselves a true Armament
user. The coating of willpower hardens the

00:03:56.810 --> 00:04:01.569
skin and gives it increased attack and defense
in terms of physical combat. Additionally,

00:04:01.569 --> 00:04:06.640
it also serves as a weapon against devil fruit
users, since the use of Haki is able to nullify

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:10.510
a devil fruit´s power. Now, this effect can
also be extended to any object that is in

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:15.140
contact with the body, since it allows a direct
flow of willpower. We most commonly see this

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:19.881
happening with swords or clothing. But what
does that actually do? So, for instance, when

00:04:19.881 --> 00:04:24.940
Zoro coats his swords in Haki, it increases
their level of hardness significantly, making

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:29.540
it stronger and less likely to break. Once
he loses hold of his weapon though, the flow

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:33.900
of Haki stops and the blade goes back to normal.
And, this brings us to the second type of

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:38.460
use: Infusing Armament into Objects for a
short amount of time WITHOUT actually keeping

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:42.330
direct contact.
As we just saw with the example of Zoro, usually

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:46.970
the flow of Haki STOPS when an object loses
contact with the user’s body. Yet, we have

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:51.630
seen an example, where this what not actually
the case. When Luffy was sent to Amazon Lilly

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:56.030
by Kuma, the Kuja tribe of the island actually
had the ability to infuse their arrows with

00:04:56.030 --> 00:05:00.610
Haki, which made them ridiculously strong
and effective. While this is the ONLY case,

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:05.160
where we have seen this ability officially
in the story so far, it proves that Haki can

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:09.800
be stored inside an object for a certain amount
of time, even without keeping contact. To

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:13.620
achieve this, I believe special training would
be required. And I would not be surprised

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:17.800
to be introduced to variations of this, like
Haki infused bullets in the story in the near

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:21.490
future. Why else for instance would Kizaru
be threatened by Ben Beckman pointing a gun

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:25.830
at him? But that is another question.
Now, the REAL question here is, whether objects

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:30.419
can also be infused with Haki over a LONGER
amount of time. Which brings us to the third

00:05:30.419 --> 00:05:35.610
type of armament use: Permanent Haki infusion.
And this brings us back to our good friend

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:41.050
Gyukimaru, who suggested to us that Shusui
turned into a black blade over time by frequent

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:45.390
use through a mighty swordsman. If this actually
ties back to the repeated infusion of a blade

00:05:45.390 --> 00:05:49.800
with Haki, that would mean that it is possible
to permanently store your willpower in an

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:53.770
object. Or in other words, making it permanently
coated in Armament.

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:57.650
And while we have only seen this technique
being used with weapons so far, I do not see

00:05:57.650 --> 00:06:01.590
any reason why that should not be possible
with any other object as well. So, let´s

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:05.880
think. Are there any objects in the One Piece
world that seem to display these distinct

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:10.509
traits of Haki infusion? And the answer to
this unnecessarily dramatical rhetoric question

00:06:10.509 --> 00:06:15.490
is YES. Poneglyphs actually seem to fit perfectly
into this category. So, let´s take a look

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:18.539
at what Poneglyphs actually are and why they
might be Haki-made.

00:06:18.539 --> 00:06:25.060
800 years ago, in Wano, a clan of master stonemasons
known as the Kozuki Family, created indestructible

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:29.580
stone blocks that recorded important historical
events from the void century. These stone

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:34.770
blocks would become known as the Poneglyphs.
Physically, Poneglyphs are massive cube-shaped

00:06:34.770 --> 00:06:39.080
rocks made of an apparently indestructible
type of stone, that carry ancient text on

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:43.660
their surface. Their creators, the Kozuki
Family, passed down the knowledge of how to

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:48.050
read and write these ancient letters within
their family up until Kozuki Oden. Due to

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:52.759
his execution though, he couldn't pass on
his knowledge, making Robin, the survivor

00:06:52.759 --> 00:06:56.729
of Ohara, the LAST person in the world, capable
of deciphering these ancient symbols.

00:06:56.729 --> 00:07:02.380
In total, there are three types of Poneglyphs
scattered across the world; Historical Poneglyphs,

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:07.400
Instructional Poneglyphs and Road Poneglyphs:
"Historical Poneglyphs" contain pieces of

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:11.490
ancient history during the void century.
"Instructional Poneglyphs" contain information

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:16.430
about the locations of the Historical Poneglyphs.
And finally, the 4 "Road Poneglyphs" together

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:21.100
detail the location of Raftel, the final Island
on the grand line that contains the legendary

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:23.770
One Piece.
Now, I think, that it is fair to say that

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:28.590
the Poneglyphs are of incredible importance.
They carried the secrets of the ancient kingdom

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:32.500
and the void century through the ages without
the world government being able to destroy

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:37.731
them. What then made these blocks of stone
survive for over 900 years unscratched? Was

00:07:37.731 --> 00:07:41.460
it the material they were made out of? Then
how in the world, were the Kozuki able to

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:46.810
write on them? A much likelier answer is that
the Poneglyphs are actually Haki infused Objects.

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:51.509
Let´s look at the arguments for this:
The first, and most obvious clue we have is

00:07:51.509 --> 00:07:56.060
the indestructability and agelessness of the
Poneglyphs. Just like the black blades, we

00:07:56.060 --> 00:08:01.330
talked about earlier, they appear to be unbreakable.
Also, similar like a black blade would never

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:05.620
rust, the rock that they are made out of never
shows any sign of erosion or cracking. They

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:10.199
are simply prefect Cubes, preserved in time.
Having them permanently coated in Haki would

00:08:10.199 --> 00:08:14.620
defiantly explain this phenomenon.
The second argument is the existence of Devil

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:19.509
Fruits. Now, I would argue that it is 100%
certain that more than one person in some

00:08:19.509 --> 00:08:23.700
point in time tried to destroy a Poneglyph
with his devil fruit power. And we have seen

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:27.630
the destructive power some of these fruits
have. If you imagine someone wielding a power

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:32.150
like Whitebeards gura-gura no mi, it seems
highly unlikely that any type of rock, no

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:37.229
matter how special, could withstand such forces.
With the Poneglyphs covered in Haki though,

00:08:37.229 --> 00:08:41.019
the whole situation would look completely
different. The nullifying powers of Haki would

00:08:41.019 --> 00:08:45.839
explain why no Devil Fruit power, no matter
how strong, would ever be able to put even

00:08:45.839 --> 00:08:50.319
as much as a scratch on the stone´s surface,
since it would be nullified on contact.

00:08:50.319 --> 00:08:55.670
The third clue is the mystery around the voices
of all things. Gol D. Roger was able to sense

00:08:55.670 --> 00:09:00.860
the content of the Poneglyphs without actually
being able to read them. Now, while this could

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:05.160
indeed be a completely new and unrelated power,
would it not make so much more sense, if Roger

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:09.790
was able to interpret the will that was poured
into the creation of the stone. The importance

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:14.040
and urgency that was used to create this record
of ancient history would have been imprinted

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:18.509
in the stone itself. The ability to hear the
voices of all things might in the end simply

00:09:18.509 --> 00:09:23.110
be an even more unique form of Haki that allows
their user to interpret a being´s will on

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:27.829
a completely different level. Having an object
that is filled to the brim with willpower,

00:09:27.829 --> 00:09:31.809
carrying a message of grave emotional and
historic importance would definitely radiate

00:09:31.809 --> 00:09:35.529
what was engraved in it.
Lastly, we can take a look at the coloring

00:09:35.529 --> 00:09:39.989
of Poneglyphs. Now, I am well aware that this
argument can be seen as a little controversial

00:09:39.989 --> 00:09:44.739
but bear with me here. Regular Poneglyphs
have a dark-blueish to black coloring that

00:09:44.739 --> 00:09:49.759
gives them their mysterious appearance. This
dark coating definitely resembles the coloring

00:09:49.759 --> 00:09:53.769
we can see in other instances of Armament
Haki being used. The Road Poneglyphs on the

00:09:53.769 --> 00:09:58.190
other hand are red. This special type of coloring
in armament can be seen when strong enough

00:09:58.190 --> 00:10:03.260
Haki is being used. Luffy´s gear 4th has
a similar red glow to it, Virgo and Pica were

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:08.410
purple and Katakuri had a blue glow surrounding
him. Additionally, we know that stronger Haki

00:10:08.410 --> 00:10:13.189
takes on distinct shapes, like the flame pattern
that we see with Luffy or Big Mom. The red

00:10:13.189 --> 00:10:16.889
color scheme of the Road Poneglyphs might
also be related to the red we see displayed

00:10:16.889 --> 00:10:21.019
when two users of conqueror’s Haki clash.
Now, while it might be easy to say that the

00:10:21.019 --> 00:10:25.290
Poneglyph’s color scheme is related to that
of Armament Haki, I am well aware of the fact

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:31.230
that the color aspect of Haki is still controversial.
It is not clear in many cases if it is a design

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:36.629
choice or intentional. Yet the term “color”
is explicitly used in the full description

00:10:36.629 --> 00:10:41.160
for Haki and is being used in the manga as
well. In my opinion, since Armament can also

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:45.329
be translated as the “color of Arms” it
might very well serve as a legitimate fourth

00:10:45.329 --> 00:10:48.300
argument here.
All in all, I think that the theory that the

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:52.670
Poneglyphs are made using Haki infusion has
some very solid arguments, that would explain

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:56.709
a lot of the mystery surrounding them. It
would also bring more importance to the role

00:10:56.709 --> 00:11:00.199
of armament Haki in this arc.
Now as a conclusion, I would like to give

00:11:00.199 --> 00:11:03.569
you guys a few questions to ponder upon after
watching this video:

00:11:03.569 --> 00:11:06.670
Do you think you could break a Poneglyph with
strong enough Haki?

00:11:06.670 --> 00:11:10.199
How many people might have worked on creating
a Poneglyph in the first place and how good

00:11:10.199 --> 00:11:14.680
were they with Haki?
What other Objects might be infused with Haki?

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:18.819
And finally, do you have any additional arguments
for or against this theory?

00:11:18.819 --> 00:11:20.759
Share your thoughts and ideas in the comments
below.

00:11:20.759 --> 00:11:24.949
